        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/paul/{size}/5862_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-02-20T19:44:09.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Today, I made the somewhat difficult decision to ban Envisioner from the Greater Than Games forum for repeated and flagrant violation of the <a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/official-forum-rules\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Official Forum Rules</a>, most notably:</p><div>1. Be respectful</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>3. Stay relatively on topic</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>4. Obey the Admins</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>5. Obey the mods</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>6. Keep cursing to a minimum</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>14. Be respectful</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>While we appreciate every fan of the game, we also feel a responsability to this forum community and a desire to have the most awesome community we can, complete with healthy discourse. If anyone has any questions or concerns about this issue, please contact me privately at paul@greaterthangames.com.</div>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:40:25.801Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
