        "title_is_group": false,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Today, I made the somewhat difficult decision to ban Envisioner from the Greater Than Games forum for repeated and flagrant violation of the <a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/official-forum-rules\">Official Forum Rules</a>, most notably:</p><div>1. Be respectful</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>3. Stay relatively on topic</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>4. Obey the Admins</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>5. Obey the mods</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>6. Keep cursing to a minimum</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>14. Be respectful</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>While we appreciate every fan of the game, we also feel a responsability to this forum community and a desire to have the most awesome community we can, complete with healthy discourse. If anyone has any questions or concerns about this issue, please contact me privately at paul@greaterthangames.com.</div>",
