        "created_at": "2014-04-04T14:36:50.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Due to the preponderance of evidence from forum dialogue, private messages, and digital examination, we have been convinced that Edwin was in fact the same person as Envisioner. As a consequence, the Edwin account has also been banned.</p>",
